OL,3,GNEWSA'Major delays' as section of A52
OL,4,Aclosed after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crash on the A52 near
OL,7,FRadcliffe-on-Trent is causing "major
OL,8,Fdelays".
OL,10,FThe A52, at its junction with
OL,11,FStragglethorpe Road eastbound, was shut
OL,12,Fon Tuesday morning, Nottingham City
OL,13,FTransport said.
OL,15,FEmergency services are on scene dealing
OL,16,Fwith the incident, said NCT.
OL,18,FOne eyewitness told the BBC he saw a
OL,19,Fcar on its side as he drove by.
